    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SOCIETY FOR AMERICAN BASEBALL RESEARCH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Society for American Baseball Research is an organization that ranks and recognizes individuals in baseball history, ranking Doug Harvey as the second-greatest umpire in history."</data>
